{
  "name": "Alfred WhatsApp — mensagem recebida → pendência → resposta",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "alfred-whatsapp",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook Evolution",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000bbbb",
      "notes": "Configure na Evolution: POST /webhook/set/alfred → url http://n8n:5678/webhook/alfred-whatsapp, base64 true, events [MESSAGES_UPSERT]. Responde 200 na hora (onReceived): o processamento (LLM + TTS) leva ~1 min."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "e1", "name": "base_url", "value": "http://172.17.0.1:7072", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "e2", "name": "token", "value": "COLE_AQUI_O_SHELL_EXECUTOR_TOKEN", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "e3", "name": "evolution_url", "value": "http://evolution-api:8080", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "e4", "name": "evolution_apikey", "value": "COLE_AQUI_A_EVOLUTION_API_KEY", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "e5", "name": "instance", "value": "alfred", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 0],
      "notes": "evolution_url é o nome do serviço no docker-compose (mesma rede alfred-net). base_url é o host visto do container."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.base_url }}/whatsapp/webhook",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [ { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $json.token }}" } ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Webhook Evolution').item.json.body) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 600000 }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "POST /whatsapp/webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 0],
      "notes": "O Python faz tudo: transcreve o áudio, classifica, cria a pendência (texto + mp3) OU — se a mensagem é de Pedro citando uma pergunta do Alfred — registra a resposta e envia ao contato. Devolve {acao, notificacao:{numero, texto, audio_url}}."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "f1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.notificacao && $json.notificacao.numero ? true : false }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Tem algo para avisar Pedro?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [660, 0],
      "notes": "notificacao existe quando: pendencia_criada (resumo + áudio + 'responda citando esta mensagem'), agrupada (mais uma mensagem do mesmo contato) ou resposta_registrada (confirmação de envio). Vazio = ignorada/duplicada/spam."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.evolution_url }}/message/sendText/{{ $('Config').item.json.instance }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [ { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $('Config').item.json.evolution_apikey }}" } ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ number: $json.notificacao.numero, text: $json.notificacao.texto }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Evolution: texto para Pedro",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [900, -100],
      "notes": "O texto termina com 'ref: <id da pendência>'. Quando Pedro responder CITANDO esta mensagem, o webhook volta com a citação e o Python casa o ref → POST /pendencias/{id}/responder-texto → envia ao contato."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "f2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('POST /whatsapp/webhook').item.json.notificacao.audio_url ? true : false }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Tem áudio da pergunta?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1120, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.base_url }}{{ $('POST /whatsapp/webhook').item.json.notificacao.audio_url }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [ { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $('Config').item.json.token }}" } ] },
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "file", "outputPropertyName": "data" } } }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "GET /pendencias/{id}/audio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1340, -200],
      "notes": "Baixa o .mp3 da pergunta (recado de voz do Alfred) como binário."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "binaryToPropery",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "destinationKey": "audio_b64",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "mp3 → base64",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1560, -200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').item.json.evolution_url }}/message/sendWhatsAppAudio/{{ $('Config').item.json.instance }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": { "parameters": [ { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $('Config').item.json.evolution_apikey }}" } ] },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ number: $('POST /whatsapp/webhook').item.json.notificacao.numero, audio: $json.audio_b64, encoding: true }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Evolution: áudio para Pedro",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1780, -200],
      "notes": "encoding: true → a Evolution converte o mp3 em OGG/Opus e entrega como mensagem de voz."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Evolution": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Config", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Config": { "main": [ [ { "node": "POST /whatsapp/webhook", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "POST /whatsapp/webhook": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Tem algo para avisar Pedro?", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Tem algo para avisar Pedro?": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Evolution: texto para Pedro", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ], [] ] },
    "Evolution: texto para Pedro": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Tem áudio da pergunta?", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "Tem áudio da pergunta?": { "main": [ [ { "node": "GET /pendencias/{id}/audio", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ], [] ] },
    "GET /pendencias/{id}/audio": { "main": [ [ { "node": "mp3 → base64", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] },
    "mp3 → base64": { "main": [ [ { "node": "Evolution: áudio para Pedro", "type": "main", "index": 0 } ] ] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "meta": {
    "alfred": "Fluxo: Evolution (messages.upsert) → Webhook → POST /whatsapp/webhook (Python transcreve/classifica/cria a pendência OU registra a resposta citada de Pedro e envia ao contato) → se houver `notificacao`, manda a Pedro o texto (com 'ref: <id>') e o áudio da pergunta. A resposta de Pedro é uma mensagem CITANDO a do Alfred: ela entra por este mesmo webhook e o Python chama responder_texto() → sendText ao contato. Edite o nó Config (token, evolution_apikey, instance)."
  }
}
